{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S08、S09这类短段里话与感受纵向交错，第一眼定位不如X左右分栏直接。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出每段叙事的关键落点，话与感受又能随音乐进程交替出现，既容易抓住人物当下的心思，也能看见情绪如何一步步变化。尤其是想念从前的亲近、记起受过的气、害怕孤单却不甘心回头之间的拉扯，Y交代得更清楚，前后也形成了完整的心理脉络。它的音乐感受还具体到了旋律、节奏、音色和身体反应，细腻程度明显胜过X；X的优势主要是左右分栏更利于快速扫读，但部分感受像并列标签，音乐与人物心理的对应关系没有Y充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7ae740ce-7f44-4d49-8c69-db6765faa40d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T054418403387Z", "elapsed_seconds": 53.234, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:45:11.656104+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a1766e566b9611a8c588709f3a61859dff624100ee01c8a2c4e0a64fb447dd6a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_